# CI/CD, Code Owners & Skills Rules

- Consult `skills/abeta-kmp-cicd/SKILL.md`, `skills/abeta-kmp-module-review/SKILL.md`, and `agents/owners/cicd-platform-owner.md`.
- Keep every module mapped in BOTH `.github/CODEOWNERS` and `agents/owners/<module>-owner.md`.
- Keep CI workflows least-privilege (`permissions:`, `concurrency:`) and ensure PR checks pass deterministically without requiring external LLM API keys.
- Run `./scripts/check_brand_hygiene.sh` and `./scripts/check_architecture_and_owners.sh` after any edit.
